<title>USA: CUC to acquire Hebdo Mag Int'l in $440 mln stock swap.</title>
<headline>CUC to acquire Hebdo Mag Int'l in $440 mln stock swap.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CUC International Inc. said Thursday it would acquire Hebdo Mag International Inc., a Paris-based international publisher and distributor of classified advertising, in a stock swap valued at $440 million.</p>
<p>CUC is expected to close an $11 billion merger with HFS Inc. in the fall.</p>
</text>
